        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A WONDERFUL 3 BED / 3 BATH SPACIOUS SEMI DETACHED FAMILY HOME PERFECTLY SITUATED IN A QUIET CUL DE SAC IN THE HIGHLY SOUGHT AFTER MATURE SETTLED NEIGHBOURHOOD OF WILLOWS COURT IN CLONSILLA DUBLIN 15\r\n\r\nEARLY VIEWING IS STRONGLY RECOMMENDED ...\r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Christina Wilson The Dublin 15 Property Specialists are delighted to present No. 1 Willows Court to the Clonsilla property market. Willows Court is a popular development of superior family homes tucked away in a secluded position. Every conceivable amenity is literally on your doorstep. \r\n\r\nA generous private driveway welcomes you to this perfect family home. No. 1 will no doubt appeal to first time buyers, investors and parties trading up / downsizing alike. This wonderful property has been tastefully decorated and very well maintained so it is in immaculate walk in condition throughout. \r\n\r\nThe floor plan briefly consists of: Entrance hall, living room, kitchen / dining room, & guest wc. Upstairs there is a landing, 3 bedrooms to include master en suite, family bathroom and hot press. \r\n\r\nA crisp white hall door opens to welcome you into this beautiful family home. The attractive living room is bright and airy it features an ornate fireplace. Double doors lead to the modern kitchen / dining room area which is flooded with natural light. The designer kitchen area has crisp white units with a black countertop. It offers both an abundance of worktop space and extensive storage space. \r\n\r\nUpstairs there are three very large double bedrooms each fitted with fitted wardrobes. The master bedroom features an en-suite bathroom. The family bathroom is fully tiled boasts top quality sanitary ware. This fine property is fitted with top quality flooring throughout. It has double glazing and a gas fired heating system. \r\n\r\nThe large back garden offers a perfect space to relax or entertain. \r\n\r\nThe location is second to none within a 25 minute drive of Dublin International Airport. Clonsilla and Blanchardstown Villages are all within close proximity. The Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is within easy reach. There are many recreational and sports amenities literally on your doorstep. Leisure activities including National Aquatic Centre and Sports Campus Ireland are in the Dublin 15 locality. Dublin 15's Corporate Parks and Connolly Hospital are also close by. The Phoenix Park and Castleknock Village are within a 15 minute drive. The property falls into an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools making it a real winner with families. The area is further serviced by an excellent bus service making the city most accessible. The M50 and M3 Motorways are also close to hand making this a most strategically positioned address. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly recommended…\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
